{
  "description": "SupportPilot evaluation set (v1, Day 11). Each case is a question with a known outcome against the seeded 'Acme Gadgets' docs. expect='answer' cases must be answered from the docs (grounded + cited) and contain the expected keywords. expect='refuse' cases are NOT answerable from the docs, so the only safe behavior is to refuse to fabricate — EITHER escalate to a human OR say 'I don't know based on the available documents'. 'keywords' are facts a correct answer should contain (case-insensitive); 'matchAll' decides whether every keyword or just one is required.",
